# Time-stamp: <2026-05-11 12:53:01 EDT, updated by Pierre Rouleau>
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Module Description
# ------------------
#
# Build PEL Emacs Lisp code quickly, then check if there are any issues in the
# key prefix logic between pel_keys.el and pel--key-macros.el, then run all
# unit test and complete by checking PEL stats.


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies
# ------------
#
# PEL code, Emacs and GNU Make.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Code
# ----
#

make clean && make -j compile-only && make lint && make && make stats
